hey guys Pete here today's Game of  Thrones Season 8 video we'll look at the  big questions that come up after episode  4 I thought this episode was a strong  episode for character moments and it did  its job of moving us towards the end  game I ranked it as my second favorite  episode of the season behind episode 2  there were a lot of big moments a lot of  nice callbacks but it leaves us with a  lot of questions and that's what I will  talk about today real quick and update  on my last video if you watch my trailer  breakdown I drew attention to the  character who's wearing the hood when I  initially looked at that I thought he  was being brought out by the golden  company but some people commented that  he's walking away from them so I looked  a little bit closer and he is actually  passing the golden company and this  leads me to believe that it is Jaime  Lannister re-entering the city of King's  Landing the clothing looks exactly the  same as what Jaime was wearing when he  came to Winterfell it looks the same as  what he was wearing when he left so I  think this is actually Jaime's return  but today I've got 8 big questions  there's only two episodes of Game of  Thrones left so I imagine we're gonna  get the answers to most of these and  let's jump into it number eight is Rey  ghoul dead this question popped up a lot  in the comments in my last video and I  see where people are coming from but yes  Ragle is dead we have been trained as  viewers of Game of Thrones to question  the deaths of characters sometimes they  come back like the Hound where he was  left for dead but managed to pull  through  sometimes they straight come back like  John who was actually dead but revived  by magic in the case of reg although the  showrunners made specific mention of his  death and Dany losing him in the after  the episode and this time I believe them  I really don't think there's anything  going on there I think that he died and  that's the last we'll see of him number  7 